; Probe — per-service readiness wait.
;
; `Probe.wait_service` blocks a single fiber until a service reaches
; its terminal state; `Probe.wait_all` parallelises the per-service
; wait across a Switch and returns one result_row per service. Both
; honour an overall deadline shared across services.
(library
 (name probe)
 (public_name pctl.probe)
 (libraries schema systemctl eio eio.unix mtime unix))
